# Stack Test
# Carbon (C) — real density 2.267 g/cm³. three cubes stacked — simulate: collapse checks the load path.
scene "Carbon Stack Test"

bottom = cube 20mm material: carbon at (0, 10mm, 0)
middle = cube 20mm material: carbon at (0, 30mm, 0)
top = cube 20mm material: carbon at (0, 50mm, 0)
simulate: collapse
